provision: /etc/vaultgenome (family aws-sev-snp, peer aws-sev-snp, sealer auto)
  key material: /etc/vaultgenome/secrets (acp-keygen, private modes)
  AMD VLEK chain (the chip's product): /etc/vaultgenome/amd-milan-vlek-cert_chain.pem (Milan; ARK 69d063b45344d26a2e94e1f4210de49ef555308287d4c174445c95639a540bcd, a root this build pins)
  configurations: /etc/vaultgenome/sagvd.json, /etc/vaultgenome/acp-compute.json
  sagvd identity: 1d8ee9bae96e2b88e7dab179eca3229827f658cb04fbe814f59b5f4312edcb07a7e9d98141b152db1063379046c1bf5b (aws-sev-snp)
  acp-compute identity: 1d8ee9bae96e2b88e7dab179eca3229827f658cb04fbe814f59b5f4312edcb07a7e9d98141b152db1063379046c1bf5b (aws-sev-snp)
  audit public key: /etc/vaultgenome/operator/audit_public_key.pem (keep it off the host: it verifies the log)
  sagvd key files sealed (sev-snp-derived-key): keys.authority_signing.seed_path, keys.session_sealing.material_path, keys.audit_signing.seed_path, vault.tls.server_key, http_api.bearer_token_file
  acp-compute key files sealed (sev-snp-derived-key): keys.worker_signing.seed_path, keys.session_sealing.material_path, vault.tls.client_key
provision.json: /etc/vaultgenome/provision.json
  REST token (the operator's copy): /etc/vaultgenome/operator/api_token (not printed)
{
  "schema": "vault-genome/acpctl-provision/v1",
  "role": "both",
  "phase": "complete",
  "out": "/etc/vaultgenome",
  "provider": "auto",
  "peer_provider": "aws-sev-snp",
  "sealer": "auto",
  "binaries": {
    "acp-compute": "/opt/vaultgenome/bin/acp-compute",
    "keygen": "/opt/vaultgenome/bin/acp-keygen",
    "sagvd": "/opt/vaultgenome/bin/sagvd"
  },
  "secrets": "/etc/vaultgenome/secrets",
  "configs": {
    "acp-compute": "/etc/vaultgenome/acp-compute.json",
    "sagvd": "/etc/vaultgenome/sagvd.json"
  },
